WEBVTT

00:03:27.717 --> 00:03:30.010
They burned them and got a new set.

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:31.720
There was no Internet. There was no phone.

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:35.629
There was no communication
with the outside world up there.

00:03:35.629 --> 00:03:38.459
There was no cooked food.

00:03:38.459 --> 00:03:41.030
There was nothing up there

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.930
that young men typically like:

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:46.211
no cars, no girls, no television, nothing

00:03:46.211 --> 00:03:48.075
except combat.

00:03:48.075 --> 00:03:52.036
Combat they did learn to like.

00:03:52.036 --> 00:03:54.487
I remember one day, it was a very hot day

00:03:54.487 --> 00:03:56.253
in the spring,

00:03:56.253 --> 00:03:58.634
and we hadn't been in a fight

00:03:58.634 --> 00:04:01.080
in a couple of weeks, maybe.